    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Murphy Mullan are delighted to present this beautiful three bedroom end of terrace home, offering spacious, flexible and well balanced accommodation in a highly convenient location. \r\n\r\nMaintained in excellent condition throughout, 400 Mourne Road has been thoughtfully extended to create a generous kitchen and dining space, an inviting and practical heart of the home ideal for everyday family life and entertaining. A separate utility room and study / playroom provide valuable additional storage and functionality, a spacious living room and downstairs bathroom with walkin shower complete the ground floor. Upstairs, the bedroom accommodation comprises two double bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with en suite, together with one single bedroom.\r\n\r\nOutside to the rear, is paved garden with side access, to the front is off street for two cars.\r\n\r\nDrimnagh and Mourne Road are a mature and well established residential location, prized for its strong community atmosphere and proximity to the city centre. The property enjoys convenient access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, parks, sporting facilities and public transport services. The nearby Luas Red Line offers a fast and reliable connection to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M50, N7 and other principal routes are also readily accessible, making the location particularly convenient for commuters.\r\n\r\nOffering generous accommodation, flexible living space and an exceptionally convenient location, 400 Mourne Road is an excellent choice for first time buyers, growing families or anyone seeking a comfortable and well maintained home close to the city centre.\r\n\r\n(All information provided is for guidance purposes only. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of the details provided.)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tPrivate off-street parking for two cars\r\n•\tMature and convenient residential setting\r\n•\tEasy access to Dublin city centre\r\n•\tConvenient to the Luas Red Line\r\n•\tClose to local schools, shops and recreational amenities\r\n•\tViewing is highly recommended\r\n•\tGenerous extended kitchen and dining space\r\n•\tVersatile downstairs study/playroom\r\n•\tSeparate utility room"
      },
